<title>FRANCE: French agents gross export turnover/tonnage rise.</title>
<headline>French agents gross export turnover/tonnage rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industry association, SNAGFA said gross turnover from export traffic generated by some 301 French air freight forwarding agents in 1996 totalled 5.8 billion francs, up 2.65 percent on 1995 levels.</p>
<p>Export tonnage handled by French agents last year showed a six percent rise on 1995, SNAGFA added.</p>
<p>SNAGFA members elected Swissair as its Cargo Airline of the Year, succeeding Air France.</p>
